---
config:
  layout: fixed
---
flowchart LR
    A(["Input"]) --> B["Task / Constraint Data"]
    B --> C["Planning Agent<br>(LLM)"]
    C --> D["Evaluator: Check plan quality <br>(auto-check)"]
    D -- pass --> E["Human Review<br>(approve / edit)"]
    D -- fail --> C
    E -- approve --> F(["Final Plan"])
    E -- not accepted --> C

    D@{ shape: decision}
    A:::input
    B:::data
    C:::agent
    D:::check
    E:::review
    F:::final

    classDef input fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#818cf8,color:#1e1b4b
    classDef data fill:#ecfeff,stroke:#22d3ee,color:#164e63
    classDef agent fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#3b0764
    classDef check fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#fb923c,color:#7c2d12
    classDef review fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#4ade80,color:#14532d
    classDef final fill:#fefce8,stroke:#facc15,color:#713f12